{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人必重歸故土"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華必憐憫雅各，再次揀選以色列人，把他們安置在他們自己的土地上。外族人必與他們聯合，歸入雅各家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["列邦必帶他們重返故鄉。在耶和華賜給他們的土地上，外族人必做他們的僕婢。他們必擄掠以前擄掠他們的人，統治以前壓迫他們的人。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["對巴比倫的諷刺"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華使他們脫離痛苦、悲傷和殘酷奴役的時候，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他們必這樣譏笑巴比倫王：",{"text":"「暴君滅亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴政結束了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華折斷了邪惡之人的棍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"折斷了掌權者的杖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們曾狂怒地攻伐列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無休無止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶著怒氣征服列國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大肆迫害。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今天下太平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人歡呼歌唱，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"松樹和黎巴嫩的香柏樹都因你而歡喜，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『自從你滅亡後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再沒有人上來砍伐我們。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你下到陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陰間騷動，迎接你的到來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在世上做過首領的陰魂都起身歡迎你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的先王都從座位上站起來迎候你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都對你說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『你如今也跟我們一樣軟弱無能！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你和我們一樣了！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的榮華和琴聲一同墜入陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蟲成了你的床鋪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛆成了你的被子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「明亮的晨星，黎明之子啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎麼從天上墜落下來？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這打敗列國的怎麼被砍倒在地上？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾想，『我要升到天上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的寶座高高地設立在上帝的眾星之上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要坐在遙遠的北方眾神明聚會的山上；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要升到雲天之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使自己與至高者一樣。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你必墜入陰間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掉進死亡的深坑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看見你的都定睛審視你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心想，『這就是那曾使大地震動、列國顫抖的人嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這就是那曾使天下荒涼、城邑傾覆、不肯釋放俘虜回家的人嗎？』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的君王都躺在自己華麗的陵墓中，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只有你像一根毫無用處的樹枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被拋棄在自己的墳墓外。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就像一具遭人踐踏的屍體，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與喪身刀下的人一同被扔進亂石坑裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必得不到君王的葬禮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你毀壞國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺害自己的百姓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「惡人的子孫必永遠被遺忘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的祖先罪惡深重，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"預備殺戮他的子孫吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得他們興起統治世界、到處建造城邑。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我必起來攻擊巴比倫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"剷除巴比倫的名號、餘民和子孫後代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必用毀滅的掃帚清掃它，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它成為沼澤之地和刺蝟的住所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是萬軍之耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["關於亞述的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"萬軍之耶和華起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我所定的計劃必實現，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所定的旨意必成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我的土地上擊垮亞述人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我的山上踐踏他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除去他們加在我子民身上的軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪去他們肩頭的重擔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我對全世界所定的計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是向列國伸出的懲罰之手。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華定了計劃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能阻撓呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的手已經伸出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能叫祂收回呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["關於非利士的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"亞哈斯王駕崩那年，我得到以下預言：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要因擊打你們的杖已經折斷","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"便高興。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為從那條蛇必生出一條更危險的蛇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一條會飛的毒蛇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"貧窮人必衣食無憂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"困苦人必安然度日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我必用饑荒除掉你們的根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺死你們殘存的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城門啊，哀號吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城邑啊，哭喊吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"非利士人啊，你們都戰慄吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為軍隊從北方如塵煙滾滾而來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們陣容整齊，無人掉隊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"該怎樣回覆外國的使者呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要告訴他們：「耶和華建立了錫安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂困苦的子民必在其中得到保護。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"「擊打你們的杖已經折斷」指攻擊非利士的王已死。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":29}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}